# Phase 5 — Power Platform Integration

## Goal

Add the ability to link solutions to epics

## NFRs
- use powerplatformadminv2 connector
- use 'Retrieve a list of environments' for environment picker
- use dataverse connector to list solutions from solution table


## requirement
-Per epic allow user to select solution in a dev, test, stage, and prod environment
-the ui should show a searchable environment picker, after the environment is selected it should show a searchable solution picker
- if a solution has already been selected in a prior environment then after the environment is selected it should try and auto select the solution using the SchemaName as the lookup value
- for each environment return the solution verstion and modified date
- include a clickable link to open the solution
- in a story add option to enter a version number
- in a story have the ability to select either dev,test,stage, or prod and then the ui should then show the version and if it matches the one entered